    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.03",
    "summary": "Use it in the Fight phase as soon as a friendly CHARACTER unit is picked to fight, targeting that unit. Choose one CHARACTER model there; for the rest of the phase its melee weapons gain [PRECISION]. Like any Stratagem, it can be used only once in a phase.",
